# state: any   (the golden cc9b4ced4a0f holds pathfind's profile; lane.accuracy804, #804)
# RalliSport Challenge (4D53000F): rallisport-804d.route to the race start, with no screencap in the
# race. For a HELD session (session804e.sh): the route ends at race clock ~4, and the caller starts a
# screenrecord burst at once, so the rival's close pass (race clock ~7.3-8.6) is filmed at the
# display rate with nothing else reading the screen. Every press keeps 804d's measured time
# (start-race A +140.6, race clock 0 ~+147.4).
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 20
mark booted
press START
wait 5
shot title
wait 3
press A
wait 6
press A
wait 6
shot mainmenu
# RIGHT exactly as pathfind sends it (pathfind.py send(): HATX max, HATX mid at once, then 0.35 s).
axis HATX max
axis HATX mid
wait 2.35
press A
wait 6
shot racetype
press A
wait 6
shot track
press A
wait 6
shot car
press A
wait 25
shot options
press A
wait 8
press A
wait 3
